      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹0.005 (vs ₹0.016 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.005 (down from ₹0.016 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹51.6m (down 60% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹1.39m (down 69% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 2.7% (down from 3.5% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by lower revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, the company's share price growth rate has exceeded its earnings growth rate by 50 percentage points per year, which is a significant difference in performance.",
