      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.003 (down from ₹0.004 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹12.7m (up 95% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹741.0k (down 40% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 5.9% (down from 19% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, the company's share price growth rate has exceeded its earnings growth rate by 20 percentage points per year, which is a significant difference in performance.",
