      "body": "Lesha Industries Limited approved the regularization of appointment of Mr. Yash Arun Chaudhary has as the Non-Executive Independent Director of the Company for a period of 5 years effective from November 05, 2025 to November 04, 2030.Mr. Yash Arun Chaudhary, aged 30 years, has extensive experience in managing transport and logistics businesses, demonstrating strong leadership and management capabilities. With a proven track record in driving business growth, enhancing operational efficiency, and implementing effective strategies, he brings valuable insight to the Company's Board. His managing skills will significantly contribute to guiding the Company's business decisions.",
